# The DB is PRIVATE — it holds the real source telemetry (filenames, raw quotes,
# entry_sources) and must never land here. It lives only in hypnosis-taxonomy-work.
# Nothing in the publish path writes it; this is the belt to that suspenders.
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
